<ServicePage title="Saunas" heading="Custom cedar saunas"
  description="Custom cedar saunas designed and built in Noosa and the Sunshine Coast, indoor or outdoor."
  intro="Custom cedar saunas we design and build to suit the space, inside the house or outdoors."
  trades={['Saunas']}
  cta="Thinking about a sauna? Tell us where it would go and how many people it needs to fit.">
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Design the sauna around your space and how you'll use it</li>
    <li>Build it in cedar: framing, lining, benches, door and trims</li>
    <li>Indoor saunas in an existing room, or outdoor saunas as their own building</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How a job runs</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>Site visit.</strong> We look at where the sauna would go and talk about size, layout and heater.</li>
    <li><strong>Design and quote.</strong> You get a layout and a quote.</li>
    <li><strong>Build.</strong> We build the sauna and organise the electrician for the heater.</li>
    <li><strong>Handover.</strong> We show you how everything works.</li>
  </ol>
  <Todo>confirm: heater supply and electrician arranged by us? Any heater types or brands you want named?</Todo>
  <Todo slot="no-photos">sauna photos go here once the NAS photos are copied in</Todo>
</ServicePage>
